error[L0512]: cannot pass a borrow of a local value to `year-of`
 --> run/closure_capturing_field_borrow_result.rslisp:7:21
  |
4 |   (let leaf (->car :make "Nissan" :year 2025))
  |        ---- this local is dropped when the function returns
5 |   (let label "year")
6 |   (let year-of (fn ((leaf (ref car))) (println label) (ref (:year leaf))))
  |                     ---------------- `year-of` ties this parameter to its result, so it needs a borrow that outlives the function
7 |   (println (year-of (ref leaf))))
  |                     ^^^^^^^^^^ this borrows a local value
  |
  = help: define `year-of` with `defn`, where its result can borrow from its argument
